I have the same problem with the RS/6000, and it only happens on nh3.0.10.
Curiously, exactly the same symptoms occured in the PC version.  The dev
team fixed it right away and sent out a set of source patches and a new
executable, but with the warning that the patches NOT be applied to anything
except the PC.  I haven't tried applying the patches to the RS/6000 version.

The problem seems to occur whenever you save a game and then upgrade the
RS/6000 or reboot it.  I've found that you can sometimes recover the game by
rebooting the machine and restarting the saved game.  Do this a few times,
checking your inventory each time, and at some iteration of the process you
may find all your inventory items magically restored.

The PC executable for nethack seems to run pretty well under the RS/6000 PC
simulator, by the way, and you get full color (why can't one get color on a
Unix system?)  I haven't tried duplicating the problem in the pcsim
environment, though.

Anybody have a reasonable fix?

